      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Vampire watts\nDrain while `Gear=P` **only** — Neutral is rolling, not parked, and is excluded. Watts come from `EnergyRemaining` Wh deltas over parked hours. Companion to Vampire Drain (which reports %/hr from BatteryLevel)."
      },
      "targets": [],
      "title": "Honesty — watts",
